der  get troops here get them here now we've  got to get the congress to do its  business  the former president was critical of  general milly in a statement this week  saying millie is a better politician  than he is a general  the house select committee investigating  january 6 has scheduled its first  hearing for later this month  for cbs this morning saturday chris van  cleave washington
 

